add(4, 'A business buys a Reserved Instance but stops using matching capacity halfway through its term. Which statement is correct?', ['The RI commitment continues to incur its agreed charges', 'AWS automatically cancels all charges', 'It becomes a Spot Instance', 'The RI turns into a Free Tier credit'], 'A', 'Reserved Instance je obaveza na rok; neiskorištenost sama po sebi ne ukida trošak obaveze.', 'ri')
